    "raw_text": "Senate Co-Sponsorship Memoranda by Senator Elder A. Vogel, Jr. - PA State Senate\nThis website will be retired on\nJanuary 6th, 2026\n. We're excited to introduce our new, faster, mobile-friendly site at\nwww.palegis.us\n. For more information,\nclick here\n.\ngeneral assembly\nsenate\nHome Page\nSenators\nListed Alphabetically\nListed by District Number\nContact Your Senator\nCommittees\nMeeting Schedule\nListed by Committee Assignments\nListed by Committees\nOfficers\nWho's My Legislator?\nRight-to-Know Law\nhouse\nHome Page\nRepresentatives\nListed Alphabetically\nListed by District Number\nContact Your Representative\nCommittees\nMeeting Schedule\nListed by Committee Assignments\nListed by Committees\nOfficers\nWho's My Legislator?\nRight-to-Know Law\nsession info\nlegislation\nstatutes\nlogin\nLegislation Quick Search\nEnter a search term...\nAdvanced Search\nPennsylvania State Senate\n06/30/2026 06:44 AM\nPennsylvania State Senate\nhttps://www.legis.state.pa.us/CFDocs/Legis/CSM/DisplayMemos.cfm?Chamber=S&SPick=20230&MemberID=1189\nShare:\nHome\n/\nSenate Co-Sponsorship Memoranda\nSenate Co-Sponsorship Memoranda\nNEW!\nSubscribe to receive notifications of new Co-Sponsorship Memos circulated\nBy Member\n|\nBy Date\n|\nKeyword Search\nSenate of Pennsylvania\nSession of 2023 - 2024 \r\n        Regular Session\nSearch Results\n31\nResults are displayed below for co-sponsorship memoranda\r\n    \r\n        by Senator\nElder A. Vogel, Jr.\n.\nSort Results By:\nDate (Newest first)\nDate (Oldest first)\nMember Name\nSubject\nMember\nSubject\nIntroduced\n7-17-2024\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nDesignating September 2024 as Hunger Action Month in Pennsylvania\nSR322\n6-12-2024\nSen. Ryan P. Aument\nand\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nAgriculture Innovation Grant Program\nSB1269\n5-15-2024\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nand\nSen. Judith L. Schwank\nIncreasing PA Dairy Farmer Access to the Dairy Margin Coverage Program\nSB1229\n5-14-2024\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nDesignating May 14, 2024 as IgA Neuropathy Awareness Day\nSR304\n3-26-2024\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nDesignating June 2024 as “Dairy Month” in Pennsylvania\nSR303\n3-26-2024\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nDesignating April 2024 as “Safe Digging Month\" in Pennsylvania\nSR269\n2-22-2024\nSen. Doug Mastriano\nand\nSen. Michele Brooks\n,\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nTax Deduction for East Palestine Train Derailment Relief Payments\nSB1149\n2-22-2024\nSen. Gene Yaw\nand\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nRecognizing “Conservation District Week” in Pennsylvania\nSR276\n1-09-2024\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nRecognizing National FFA Week in Pennsylvania (February 17th through the 24th, 2024)\nSR245\n12-08-2023\nSen. Greg Rothman\nand\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nHunting for Crop Damage Solutions: Legislative Package\nSB1086\nSB1087\nSB1088\nSB1089\n11-27-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nand\nSen. Judith L. Schwank\nSupporting Pennsylvania’s Dairy Farmers\nSB1297\n9-26-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nand\nSen. Wayne Langerholc, Jr.\nIncreasing Penalties for Fentanyl Distribution Involving Minors\nSB1030\n7-18-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nDesignating September 2023 as Hunger Action Month in Pennsylvania\nSR157\n6-14-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nStandardizing Statewide Rodeo Practices\n4-17-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nLicensure of Professional Music Therapists\nSB898\n4-14-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nand\nSen. Judith L. Schwank\nRecognizing the 150th Anniversary of the Pennsylvania State Grange\nSR156\n4-04-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nDesignating June 2023 as \"Dairy Month\" in Pennsylvania\nSR121\n3-08-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nClearly Defining Milk in Pennsylvania\n2-21-2023\nSen. Michele Brooks\nand\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\n,\nSen. David G. Argall\nResolution Urging the USDA to Allow 2% and Whole Milk in Schools\nSR48\n2-16-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nand\nSen. Judith L. Schwank\nAssisting Pennsylvania's Dairy Industry\n1-25-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nUpdates to Pennsylvania's Dog Law\nSB746\n1-24-2023\nSen. Michele Brooks\nand\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nResolution Sharing the Senate of Pennsylvania’s Opposition to the Waters of the United States (WOTUS) Rule\nSR76\n1-24-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nand\nSen. Gene Yaw\nRecognizing “Conservation District Week” in Pennsylvania\nSR84\n1-10-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nand\nSen. Art Haywood\nFunding PHARE\nSB532\n1-03-2023\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nRecognizing National FFA Week in Pennsylvania (February 19-26, 2023)\nSR33\n12-28-2022\nSen. Camera Bartolotta\nand\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nDisabled Veterans’ Property Tax Relief\nSB177\n12-06-2022\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nPennsylvania Stroke Registry\nSB828\n12-06-2022\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nStroke Protocols in Pennsylvania\n12-06-2022\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nPrecision Agriculture Grant Program\n12-06-2022\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nTelemedicine\nSB739\n12-01-2022\nSen. Elder A. Vogel, Jr.\nExpanding Access to Sexual Assault Nurse Examiners\nSB414\nVisitor Information\nInterested in visiting the State Capitol? For information on visiting the Capitol Complex, please visit\npacapitol.com\nContact\nEmail Webmaster\nContact Senator\nContact Representative\nReference\nRSS Feeds\nRight-to-K",
